# The citation toolchain (apycite + apysource) and the documents it caches.
# Python, dev-only, never a runtime dependency of the linter.
.venv/
data/cache/
data/sources/

# Coverage
*.profraw
*.profdata

# Root-level Markdown that is not checked in. Personal working notes live here
# while a piece of work is in flight; they are deliberately not part of the
# repository, and listing them by name here would put them in it. Tracked files
# are unaffected by this pattern, so `README.md` is spelled out only to say so.
# Without this, `reuse lint` counts those files and the supply-chain gate fails
# on a clean tree, and `git add -A` sweeps them into a commit.
/*.md
!/README.md
